       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-MULTI-AMBIG.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-MULTI-AMBIG-PROOFS.
           05  WS-CONSTRAINT-SATISFY-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DISAMBIGUATION-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RELAXATION-CONVERGE-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DUAL-COHERENCE-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MULTI-AMBIG-SEAL-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-MULTI-AMBIG-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-AMBIG-PROVEN         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-AMBIG-CODE         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-SATISFY-AND-DISAMBIG.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-RELAX-AND-COHERENCE.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-AMBIG-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-SATISFY-AND-DISAMBIG.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CONSTRAINT-SATISFY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DISAMBIGUATION-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-RELAX-AND-COHERENCE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RELAXATION-CONVERGE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DUAL-COHERENCE-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-AMBIG-PROOFS.
           IF WS-CONSTRAINT-SATISFY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DISAMBIGUATION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-RELAXATION-CONVERGE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DUAL-COHERENCE-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-MULTI-AMBIG-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-AMBIG-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-AMBIG-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-AMBIG-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-AMBIG-CODE.
